/886\n\nThe legend is displayed incorrectly because everything is within the span, when the text should actually be outside. My inclination is to think that change should be reverted.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chartjs/Chart.js/issues/comments/205009216/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"eemikula","id":7127702,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjc3MDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7127702?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula","html_url":"https://github.com/eemikula","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chartjs/Chart.js/issues/comments/205225097","html_url":"https://github.com/chartjs/Chart.js/issues/2192#issuecomment-205225097","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chartjs/Chart.js/issues/2192","id":205225097,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIwNTIyNTA5Nw==","user":{"login":"nagubal","id":45527,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NTI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45527?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal","html_url":"https://github.com/nagubal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-04-04T10:01:20Z","updated_at":"2016-04-04T10:02:27Z","body":"You can redefine the legendTemplate in order to revert to the previous way of generating the legend.\nIn my case, for a Doughnut Chart:\n\n``` javascript\nmyDoughnutChart = new Chart(ctx).Doughnut(arrayGroupedByResolution, {\n    ...\n    tooltipTemplate : \"<%if (label){%><%=label%>: <%}%><%= value %>\" + \" (<%= Math.round(circumference / 6.283 * 100) %>%)\",\n    legendTemplate : \"<ul class=\\\"<%=name.toLowerCase()%>-legend\\\"><% for (var i=0; i<segments.length; i++){%><li><span style=\\\"background-color:<%=segments[i].fillColor%>\\\"></span><%if(segments[i].label){%><%=segments[i].label%><%}%></li><%}%></ul>\"\n});\n```\n\nLook for the legendTemplate in the Chart._{type}_.js source files (Chart.Bar.js, Chart.Line.js, etc.) \n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chartjs/Chart.js/issues/comments/205225097/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"nagubal","id":45527,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NTI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45527?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal","html_url":"https://github.com/nagubal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nagubal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chartjs/Chart.js/issues/comments/205288356","html_url":"https://github.com/chartjs/Chart.js/issues/2192#issuecomment-205288356","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chartjs/Chart.js/issues/2192","id":205288356,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIwNTI4ODM1Ng==","user":{"login":"eemikula","id":7127702,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjc3MDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7127702?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula","html_url":"https://github.com/eemikula","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-04-04T13:05:01Z","updated_at":"2016-04-04T13:05:01Z","body":"Redefining the legendTemplate works, but it seems to me to be fixing it on the wrong end. Note that this change will also break the main page on chartjs.org whenever it's updated to version 1.1.0 - I simulated that by copying the same structure into a jsbin here: http://jsbin.com/likuwekeba/edit?html,console,output\n\nRather than having everyone who was happy with their legend need to customize their template, I think the template should be changed. If the original intent of the change was just to ensure that the text is enclosed in a tag that can be styled, then maybe there should be two separate spans used, so they can be styled independently. e.g.\n\n```\n<ul>\n <li>\n  <span class=\"legend-icon\" style=\"background-color:#d08770\"></span><span class=\"legend-text\">Text Goes Here</span>\n </li>\n</ul>\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chartjs/Chart.js/issues/comments/205288356/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"eemikula","id":7127702,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjc3MDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7127702?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula","html_url":"https://github.com/eemikula","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemikula/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"p